    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1020118388",
      "Source": "You have slain Primordius, The Celestial!<#RN#><#RN#>Raphus Essence is used to craft your very own Annunaki Dragon Matrix.<#RN#><#RN#>This can also be used to craft Primordius's Armor for additional armor value for your Celestial!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已经杀死了幻影喷火龙！<#RN#>幻影喷火龙精华被用来制作你自己的幻影喷火龙矩阵。<#RN#>这也可以用来制作幻影喷火龙的护甲，为你的幻影喷火龙提供额外的护甲值","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1048977969",
      "Source": "Fertilized Badass Frost Carnotaurus Egg",
