    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1116125808",
      "Source": "Consuming this will summon Karkinos, Warden Of The River.  \\n\\n!!AVOID SPAWNING THIS NEAR YOUR BASE!!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"消耗它会召唤河流守望者帝鳄.  \\n\\n!!不要在你的基地附近召唤!!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1119967518",
      "Source": "You have claimed this mysterious object from slaying your \"3rd\" Primal Guardian.<#RN#><#RN#>Combine all Primal Insignias to make yourself a Uber Broth in the Annunaki Chemistry Bench",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你已经从杀死你的“第三个”原始守护者中获得了这个神秘的物体。<#RN#>在起源化学工作台中组合所有的信物为自己制作一个超级肉汤","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
