    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::103461213",
      "Source": "Reused Metal Arrow but applied with narcotics. This is the strongest and highest poison dealing ammunition in the mod. This will most likely knock out larger targets with ease.<#RN#><#RN#><RichColor Color=\"0, 1, 0, 1\">Torpidity Damage: 10x</>",
